      "created_at": "2012-05-03T16:52:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>She definitely doesn’t. I’m staring at the card right now. It’s not on her character card or her rule card. You should celebrate solving a mystery!</p>\n<p>In fact, the Chairman rules card specifically refers to the Chairman as a villain character card and the Operative as ‘just’ a character card.</p>",
